{# ============================================================================
   /insights/ — rebuilt 2026-08-27 to the client's reference layout: a photo
   masthead, a venture filter, one featured row, a 2-up grid for the rest.

   Things NOT carried over from the reference, on purpose:

   1. The reference's filter pills were 5 categories (All / Education /
      Careers / Exams / Global Opportunities) that don't match anything in
      the data — most would return zero or one result. Built instead as a
      REAL filter over the venture field every post already has: All +
      the 3 actual ventures, and every option returns a real result
      (CLAUDE.md non-negotiable #3 — interactivity must navigate real
      content, not decorate).
   2. The reference showed "8 MIN READ" on all three posts. That's not
      measured from anything — kept the real readingTime filter
      (.eleventy.js) instead, which computes it from actual word count.
      All three posts are short, so it genuinely reads "1 min read" — a
      true number, not a rounder-looking invented one.

   The 2-up grid uses `grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(...))`
   (main.css), not a fixed `repeat(2, ...)`. A fixed 2-column grid was tried
   first and reintroduced the exact bug this page shipped without earlier:
   filtering down to one visible card left its sibling's column empty.
   auto-fit collapses that empty track, so a single visible card fills the
   row — no JS counting needed, and the grid still reads as 2-up whenever
   both cards are visible (the reference's actual look, by default).

   Masthead photo (masthead-notes.jpg) is stock photography (Pexels
   License, free commercial use, no attribution required) — atmospheric
   only, not a real Admizz space, same basis as the /about/ and /ventures/
   photography exceptions.
   ============================================================================ #}

<section class="insights-masthead bg-paper">
  <div class="shell insights-masthead-grid">
    <div class="fade-up">
      <span class="eyebrow">Insights</span>
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-display font-light text-display-2 text-ink max-w-[14ch] text-balance">
        Ideas for what&rsquo;s <em class="italic text-navy font-book">next.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-body-lg text-ink-muted max-w-measure-tight leading-relaxed">
        Perspectives from across Admizz Education, Admizz Institute and Admizz Workforce Solutions.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="insights-masthead-photo fade-up" style="animation-delay:80ms">
      {% imageEager "src/assets/images/insights/masthead-notes.jpg", "Someone writing out a plan by hand next to an open laptop", "(min-width: 900px) 42vw, 92vw" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-paper pb-section" x-data="{ active: 'all' }">
  <div class="shell">
    {# Real filter — every option is a venture that actually has a post
       behind it; "All" plus the 3 real values, nothing invented. #}
    <div class="insights-filters fade-up" role="group" aria-label="Filter by venture">
      <button type="button" class="insights-filter-pill" :class="active === 'all' ? 'is-active' : ''" @click="active = 'all'">All</button>
      {% for v in ventures %}
      <button type="button" class="insights-filter-pill" :class="active === '{{ v.name }}' ? 'is-active' : ''" @click="active = '{{ v.name }}'">{{ v.name | replace("Admizz ", "") }}</button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {% for post in insights %}{% if post.featured %}
    <article class="insights-feature mt-10 fade-up" x-show="active === 'all' || active === '{{ post.venture }}'">
      <a href="/insights/{{ post.slug }}/" class="insights-feature-photo">
        {% image "src/assets/images/insights/" + post.image, post.imageAlt, "(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 92vw" %}
      </a>
      <div class="insights-feature-body">
        <span class="font-mono text-micro uppercase tracking-widest text-gold-text">Featured</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display font-book text-h2 text-ink text-balance">
          <a href="/insights/{{ post.slug }}/" class="hover:text-navy-soft transition-colors duration-press ease-signature">{{ post.title }}</a>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-body text-ink-muted max-w-measure-tight leading-relaxed">{{ post.deck }}</p>
        <div class="insights-row-foot mt-5">
          <a href="/insights/{{ post.slug }}/" class="text-small font-medium text-navy link-underline">Read the article &rarr;</a>
          <span class="insights-row-time">{{ post.body | readingTime }} min read</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}

    {# Hidden outright when neither of the 2 grid posts matches the active
       filter (i.e. filtered to the featured post's own venture) — so no
       empty bordered strip is left behind either. #}
    <div class="insights-grid mt-4" x-show="active === 'all' || active === 'Admizz Institute' || active === 'Admizz Workforce Solutions'">
      {% for post in insights %}{% if not post.featured %}
      <article class="insights-card fade-up" style="animation-delay:{{ loop.index0 * 90 }}ms" x-show="active === 'all' || active === '{{ post.venture }}'">
        <a href="/insights/{{ post.slug }}/" class="insights-card-photo">
          {% image "src/assets/images/insights/" + post.image, post.imageAlt, "(min-width: 700px) 34vw, 92vw" %}
        </a>
        <span class="insights-card-num" aria-hidden="true">{{ "0" }}{{ loop.index }}</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-micro uppercase tracking-widest text-navy-soft">{{ post.venture }}</span>
        <h2 class="mt-2 font-display font-book text-h4 text-ink">
          <a href="/insights/{{ post.slug }}/" class="hover:text-navy-soft transition-colors duration-press ease-signature">{{ post.title }}</a>
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-small text-ink-muted">{{ post.deck }}</p>
        <div class="insights-row-foot mt-4">
          <a href="/insights/{{ post.slug }}/" class="text-small font-medium text-navy link-underline">Read the article &rarr;</a>
          <span class="insights-row-time">{{ post.body | readingTime }} min read</span>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-paper-sunk border-t border-rule py-section-sm">
  <div class="shell text-center fade-up">
    <p class="font-display font-light italic text-h3 text-ink-muted">That&rsquo;s everything, for now.</p>
    <a href="/ventures/" class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-small font-medium text-ink link-underline">
      More from the group
      <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 7h10M8 3l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
